    - target: {fileID: 525274506826451584, guid: 815976abe225a8b45bd181f927c9c927, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Light can alter our sense of perception and how we see things around
        us, also light goes hand in hand with colored surface, when we have a light
        source in the room, white walls reflect almost 90% of the light, acting a
        source of light.


        Lets see how light can change our percpetion of
        the space,come forward and experienbce the space of the following rooms,
        is there any difference in their size??'
